title: "lsst-impostor-search: a Rubin/LSST search for supernova impostors and LBV eruptions"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
license: BSD-3-Clause
authors:
  - family-names: Aghakhanloo
    given-names: Mojgan
    affiliation: University of Virginia
abstract: "Tools to find eruptive massive stars (supernova impostors and luminous blue variable eruptions) in Rubin Observatory/LSST data: a candidate search of Data Preview 2 on the Rubin Science Platform, and a machine-learning prototype that fine-tunes the pretrained ORACLE light-curve classifier to recognize simulated eruptions."
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aghakhanloo/lsst-impostor-search"
keywords:
  - Rubin Observatory
  - LSST
  - luminous blue variables
  - supernova impostors
  - time-domain astronomy
  - machine learning
  - transfer learning
